# Table numeric columns (`.col-numeric`)

For **amounts, counts, rates, durations, quantities**, and similar numeric data in tables:

- **Not** invoice **Number** columns (display numbers like `INV-1001` stay left-aligned like other labels).

- Add **`col-numeric`** to the matching **`th` and `td`** (both header and body).
- Styles live in `assets/layout/_app.scss` (right align + tabular figures).
- Do **not** use ad-hoc `text-right` on table cells — use `col-numeric` so headers and values align and sort icons line up on sortable columns.

Width/layout-specific classes (e.g. `invoice-line-qty-col`) stay alongside `col-numeric`.
